"Each Questor is tied to Davrar by a complex knot of power tethered to their astral body."
"The knot likely grants Travel, resurrection, and the level and Talent system itself."
"The knot feels more fundamental even than the Seals."
"Looked at closely, the knot shows ever-deeper complexity, like layered circuit boards."
"Questors resurrect on death unless their link to Davrar is destroyed."
"A slain Questor respawns elsewhere, perhaps on a distant continent."
"Questor bodies in Davrar are truly tied to their minds."
"Severing the knot strips every Talent, skill and class, leaving barely a mortal."
"After a severing, a thread from Davrar reaches out to re-establish the link."
"If allowed, Davrar reconnects as a small seed with a signature unique to that Questor."
"Some Questors can devote themselves permanently to Davrar."
